    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Create Your Own Vision\r\n\r\nIn this level, it's your turn to write your own vision and have your AI assistant create a webpage for you. Web Lab now shows you both the editable \"Code\" in the left-panel and the website \"Preview\" in the right-panel.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. Look at the `vision.txt` file that is already open. Edit this file by replacing all the [FILL IN HERE] with your own ideas.\r\n   - If you need some inspiration, you can look at the `example-vision.txt` file\r\n2. Hover over `vision.txt` in the Files sidebar and click the &nbsp; <i class=\"fa-solid fa-ellipsis-v\"></i> &nbsp; icon, then select \"Add to AI Tutor Chat\"\r\n3. In the textbox below, tell AI Tutor to make you a website based on your vision\r\n\r\nAfter AI Tutor generates your webpage and you approve the changes, click Continue to the next level.\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://images.code.org/1d3f2c474745f5421dd833bf93b7d9c4-image-1774905817292.png\" style=\"border: solid 2px white; border-radius: 5px; width: 50%;\" />",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "true",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
